{"seq":3,"slug":"carrier-tier-dynamic-share","title":"分级与份额动态调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/scorecard-grading/carrier-tier-dynamic-share","wordCount":1849,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"分级与份额动态调整\">分级与份额动态调整</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>记分卡分数要变成动作，中间必须经过分级。分级是一个把连续分数切成有限档位的动作，它的工程价值在于<strong>让下游规则可以引用少数几个离散状态</strong>——选路权重、账期、赔付比例、审计频率都按等级定义，而不是按具体分数。这样做的代价是分级边界处的跳变：79.9 分与 80.1 分的承运商拿到截然不同的待遇，而它们的实际表现几乎相同。</p>\n<p>份额调整则是分级之后最有力的动作：把表现好的承运商的货量份额提高。这一步最容易造成<strong>震荡</strong>——份额变动改变承运商的货量结构，货量结构改变其绩效，绩效又反过来影响份额，构成一个反馈回路。回路设计不当会出现两种失败：一种是振荡（份额在两个承运商之间来回摆动，每次都&quot;优化&quot;到相反方向），另一种是锁死（领先者因为获得全部货量而规模效应更好，落后者因为没货量永远无法证明自己）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[记分卡分数] --&gt; B{分级边界 + 滞后}&#10;  B --&gt;|分数上升越上界| C[升级]&#10;  B --&gt;|分数下降越下界| D[降级]&#10;  B --&gt;|在带内| E[保持原级]&#10;  C --&gt; F[份额目标重算]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[步长限制&lt;br/&gt;单期最大变动]&#10;  G --&gt; H[容量约束可行性检查]&#10;  H --&gt; I[下发选路权重]&#10;  I --&gt; J[货量结构变化]&#10;  J --&gt; K[下期绩效]&#10;  K --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[记分卡分数] --&gt; B{分级边界 + 滞后}\n  B --&gt;|分数上升越上界| C[升级]\n  B --&gt;|分数下降越下界| D[降级]\n  B --&gt;|在带内| E[保持原级]\n  C --&gt; F[份额目标重算]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[步长限制&lt;br/&gt;单期最大变动]\n  G --&gt; H[容量约束可行性检查]\n  H --&gt; I[下发选路权重]\n  I --&gt; J[货量结构变化]\n  J --&gt; K[下期绩效]\n  K --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"分级-边界-迟滞与最小停留期\">分级：边界、迟滞与最小停留期</h2><h3 id=\"迟滞带\">迟滞带</h3><p>直接在边界处切分会导致等级频繁跳变。解决方法是引入<strong>迟滞</strong>（hysteresis）：升级与降级使用不同的阈值。例如 A 级门槛是 85 分，但已进入 A 级的承运商只有跌破 80 分才降级；80–85 之间是保持带，在这个区间内维持原级不变。</p>\n<p>迟滞带宽度是一个需要显式决定的参数。带宽太窄等于没有迟滞，带宽太宽则会让表现确实下滑的承运商长期留在高等级。经验做法是<strong>带宽约等于分数的月度波动标准差</strong>——如果分数月度波动 <code>$\\pm 2$</code> 分，迟滞带取 4–5 分即可吸收大部分噪声跳变。这与<a href=\"carrier-scorecard-model\">承运商记分卡模型</a>中样本收缩的作用是一致的：两者都在对抗同一种噪声。</p>\n<h3 id=\"最小停留期\">最小停留期</h3><p>迟滞之外还需要<strong>最小停留期</strong>：进入一个等级后至少停留一个完整评估周期（通常一个季度）。理由不是统计的，而是组织的——承运商需要时间理解新等级的期望并调整运营；如果等级每两周变一次，任何改进投入的回报都无法被观测到，理性承运商会选择不投入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"等级数量\">等级数量</h3><p>等级数量在 3 到 5 之间最实用。两级的区分度太低（只有&quot;合格/不合格&quot;），超过五级则等级间的差异无法用业务规则表达清楚——当被问到&quot;B+ 与 A- 的待遇差在哪里&quot;时，如果答案只能是&quot;分数高一点&quot;，说明分级过细。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>典型分数带</th>\n<th>份额策略</th>\n<th>商业条款倾向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A（优选）</td>\n<td>≥85</td>\n<td>份额目标上调，优先分配新线路</td>\n<td>账期放宽、免部分保证金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B（合格）</td>\n<td>70–85</td>\n<td>份额稳定，按容量分配</td>\n<td>标准条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C（观察）</td>\n<td>55–70</td>\n<td>份额受限，不得承接新线路</td>\n<td>加强审计、缩短账期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D（整改）</td>\n<td>&lt;55</td>\n<td>触发整改计划与限流</td>\n<td>暂停新业务、启动退出评估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"份额调整的步长与冻结期\">份额调整的步长与冻结期</h2><h3 id=\"步长限制\">步长限制</h3><p>份额调整必须限速。一个可用的规则是<strong>单期份额变动不超过 <code>$\\pm 5$</code> 个百分点</strong>，无论分数变化多大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w*i^{(t+1)} = w_i^{(t)} + \\mathrm{clip}\\left(\\alpha \\cdot (s_i - \\bar s),\\; -\\Delta*{\\max},\\; +\\Delta\\_{\\max}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clip</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">Δ_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>$s_i - \\bar s$</code> 是该承运商分数与线路均值的差，<code>$\\alpha$</code> 是灵敏度，<code>$\\Delta_{\\max}$</code> 是单期最大变动。限速的作用是给回路一个阻尼，让系统在多个周期内收敛而不是一次跳到位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"冻结期与观测窗口\">冻结期与观测窗口</h3><p>限速之外还需要<strong>冻结窗口</strong>：在一次份额调整后，至少一个完整观测窗口（例如 6 周）内不再调整，让新份额的绩效影响有机会显现。没有冻结期的系统会陷入&quot;调整—未及观测—再调整&quot;的循环，每一次调整都是基于上一期份额结构的绩效，而那个结构已经不存在了。</p>\n<p>这一步的直觉来自控制论：反馈回路的延迟必须小于调整周期，否则回路发散。货量结构改变到绩效改变之间的延迟，包括承运商内部排班调整、装载率变化、以及绩效统计窗口的累积，在跨境场景下通常是一个月到六周。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容量约束-它其实是运输问题\">容量约束：它其实是运输问题</h3><p>份额目标算出来之后，必须检查可行性：承运商的运力不是无限的。把&quot;给定各承运商的目标份额与容量上限，如何在各线路上分配货量使成本最小&quot;写出来，得到的是经典的运输问题（Hitchcock–Koopmans）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>c</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>j</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum*{i=1}^{m}\\sum*{j=1}^{n} c*{ij}x*{ij} \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum*{j} x*{ij} \\le s*i,\\;\\; \\sum*{i} x*{ij} = d_j,\\;\\; x*{ij} \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>$s_i$</code> 是承运商 <code>$i$</code> 的容量上限，<code>$d_j$</code> 是线路 <code>$j$</code> 的货量需求，<code>$c_{ij}$</code> 是承运商 <code>$i$</code> 走线路 <code>$j$</code> 的单位成本（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transportation_theory_(mathematics)\">运输问题</a>）。当总容量恰好等于总需求时约束取等号；实践中通常要求 <code>$\\sum_i s_i &gt; \\sum_j d_j$</code> 以保留冗余，因此用不等式约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy.optimize import linprog&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def allocate(cost, capacity, demand, min_share=None):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;cost: m x n 单位成本; capacity: m 容量; demand: n 需求&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    m, n = cost.shape&#10;    c = cost.reshape(-1)&#10;    A_ub, b_ub = [], []&#10;    for i in range(m):&#10;        row = np.zeros(m * n); row[i * n:(i + 1) * n] = 1&#10;        A_ub.append(row); b_ub.append(capacity[i])&#10;    A_eq, b_eq = [], []&#10;    for j in range(n):&#10;        row = np.zeros(m * n); row[j::n] = 1&#10;        A_eq.append(row); b_eq.append(demand[j])&#10;    if min_share:                       # 保底货量：防止落后者被饿死&#10;        for i in range(m):&#10;            row = np.zeros(m * n); row[i * n:(i + 1) * n] = -1&#10;            A_ub.append(row); b_ub.append(-min_share)&#10;    res = linprog(c, A_ub=np.array(A_ub), b_ub=np.array(b_ub),&#10;                  A_eq=np.array(A_eq), b_eq=np.array(b_eq),&#10;                  bounds=(0, None), method=&quot;highs&quot;)&#10;    return res.x.reshape(m, n), res.status\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.optimize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> linprog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> allocate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cost, capacity, demand, min_share</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"cost: m x n 单位成本; capacity: m 容量; demand: n 需求\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    m, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost.reshape(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    A_ub, b_ub </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n); row[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n:(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        A_ub.append(row); b_ub.append(capacity[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    A_eq, b_eq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n); row[j::n] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        A_eq.append(row); b_eq.append(demand[j])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_share:                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 保底货量：防止落后者被饿死</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n); row[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n:(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            A_ub.append(row); b_ub.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">min_share)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    res </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> linprog(c, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">A_ub</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.array(A_ub), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b_ub</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.array(b_ub),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                  A_eq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.array(A_eq), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b_eq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.array(b_eq),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                  bounds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"highs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.x.reshape(m, n), res.status</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>min_share</code> 参数是这套模型里最关键的一行：<strong>它可以防止落后者被饿死</strong>。没有保底货量时，低成本承运商会吃掉全部货量，落后者因为样本归零而永远无法翻身，这正是&quot;锁死&quot;失败模式。保底货量保证每家承运商每期仍有足够样本产生可信的绩效估计，其本质与<a href=\"../performance-feedback-loop/score-to-routing-weight\">绩效反馈到选路权重</a>中的探索性货量是同一个机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收敛性检查\">收敛性检查</h2><p>份额调整系统上线后必须监控它是否收敛。两个可观测指标：<strong>份额的一阶差分绝对值之和</strong>（总变动量）应随时间递减；各家承运商<strong>等级的迁移率</strong>（每期改变等级的承运商比例）应稳定在一个低水平（例如每期不超过 15%）。如果两者都不下降，说明步长过大或冻结期不足，应先调参而不是继续调整份额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分级让下游规则引用少数离散状态，代价是边界跳变，用迟滞带对冲。</li>\n<li>迟滞带宽度约等于分数月度波动标准差，与记分卡中的样本收缩对抗同一种噪声。</li>\n<li>最小停留期（一个完整评估周期）是组织需要，而非统计需要。</li>\n<li>等级数量 3–5 最实用，超过五级则等级差异无法用业务规则表达。</li>\n<li>份额调整必须限速（单期 <code>$\\pm 5$</code> 个百分点量级）并设冻结窗口，否则回路发散。</li>\n<li>冻结期长度必须大于&quot;份额变化 → 绩效变化&quot;的延迟，跨境场景约一个月到六周。</li>\n<li>容量约束下的分配是运输问题，用线性规划求解，且必须设保底货量以防落后者被饿死。</li>\n<li>上线后监控总变动量与等级迁移率是否递减，不收敛先调参再继续调份额。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分级与份额动态调整","id":"分级与份额动态调整"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分级：边界、迟滞与最小停留期","id":"分级-边界-迟滞与最小停留期"},{"level":3,"text":"迟滞带","id":"迟滞带"},{"level":3,"text":"最小停留期","id":"最小停留期"},{"level":3,"text":"等级数量","id":"等级数量"},{"level":2,"text":"份额调整的步长与冻结期","id":"份额调整的步长与冻结期"},{"level":3,"text":"步长限制","id":"步长限制"},{"level":3,"text":"冻结期与观测窗口","id":"冻结期与观测窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"容量约束：它其实是运输问题","id":"容量约束-它其实是运输问题"},{"level":2,"text":"收敛性检查","id":"收敛性检查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线路/市场绩效对标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/scorecard-grading/lane-market-benchmark"},"next":{"title":"新承运商准入标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-onboard-trial/new-carrier-onboard-criteria"}}